    "description": "<p>Data described in the article:</p>\n\n<p><strong>&nbsp;Inferring kinetic rate constants from single-molecule FRET trajectories &ndash; a blind benchmark of kinetic analysis tools.</strong></p>\n\n<p>- MATLAB simulator scripts &amp; configuration files incl. parameters used in the kinSoftChallenge.</p>\n\n<p>- simulated challenge datasets used in the kinSoftChallenge.</p>\n\n<p>- experimental challenge datasets (Fig. 2) were kindly provided by Ben Schuler, University of Zurich, CH.</p>\n\n<p>- experimental challenge datasets (Fig. 5) were kindly provided by Michael Schlierf, TU Dresden, D.</p>",
